          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸 Tornado warning slammed downtown Chicago. Sirens screamed across the metro as a wall of severe storms tore in with damaging winds, pounding rain, and clear rotation spinning on radar. Whole chunks of the city and suburbs sat under the threat until late morning. Another brutal hit in what has already turned into one of the wildest severe weather summers the Midwest has ever seen. Writer: Lucas Video",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087229488925163730#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T17:27:43+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
          "org": "",
          "image_urls": [
            "https://nitter.net/pic/amplify_video_thumb%2F2087203503806595072%2Fimg%2FH2iBmhvYMSviI060.jpg"
          ],
          "articles": []
        },
        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸🇮🇷 Does the Strait of Hormuz traffic return to normal by year's end? Polymarket gives a flat 50/50 at the moment for that one. Nobody knows. $7.75M bet on this question means real money; energy traders, shipping firms, and macro funds are all sweating the same thing: Can Iran tensions actually resolve by 2027? Flip a coin. That's where we are. Source: @Polymarket / Writer: Oliver",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087227278300508543#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T17:18:56+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
          "org": "",
          "image_urls": [
            "https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHPdSBEhakAAYOyX.jpg"
          ],
          "articles": []
        },
        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇮🇱🇮🇷 Mossad agents reportedly walked through Iran's most fortified nuclear site, Fordow, \"many times.\" Former Mossad chief Yossi Cohen just casually dropped that bombshell publicly. He called the 2025 U.S. bombing of Fordow \"the realization of all my dreams\" and noted Iran's 60% enriched uranium is still \"far from a nuclear bomb.\" If Mossad was inside Fordow, Iran's most secure facility was never actually secure. Source: / Writer: Oliver",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087225455187464507#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T17:11:41+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
          "org": "",
          "image_urls": [
            "https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHPdQPC3awAAydSB.jpg",
            "https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHPdQZhmbUAAfEB4.jpg"
          ],
          "articles": []
        },
        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸🇷🇺 HE’S FINALLY GOING HOME! Fmr Marine Robert Gilman is free after more than 4 years in a Russian prison. Locked up in 2022 on disputed charges, his health had collapsed into a near-catatonic state. After direct talks with Putin, Russia released him on pure humanitarian grounds with no exchange demanded. He’s already on a plane with his mother, landing on U.S. soil tonight. Sometimes the simplest wins are the ones that matter most. Source: Truth Social / Writer: Lucas",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087224181289349264#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T17:06:38+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
          "org": "",
          "image_urls": [
            "https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHPdPUCDaUAAQEtg.jpg",
            "https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHPdPUb-bsAEpEsQ.jpg"
          ],
          "articles": []
        },
        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸 This Wisconsin hot dog vendor is done with the DSA crowd. Asked who he’s backing for governor, he skips the polite answer and goes straight at Francesca Hong: “I know who I don’t support: Viet Kong.” He’s watching a democratic socialist with ties to a group that wants to scrap ICE, phase out prisons, and overhaul the presidency, and he’s not having it. One working guy at a food cart put the whole primary mood on blast. The man is next level of pissed off about communists. Writer: Lucas Video",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087222513310867557#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T17:00:00+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
          "org": "",
          "image_urls": [
            "https://nitter.net/pic/amplify_video_thumb%2F2086958676087099392%2Fimg%2FkwS8YUsQRikxv-Hj.jpg"
