        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸 The U.S. jobs market has been lying to your face. Statistically speaking. Jobs data has been revised DOWN in 21 of the last 30 months, erasing 1.05 MILLION jobs from the record. May revised to +63K. June revised to +20K. Combined -103,000 jobs. That's the biggest 2-month downward revision since July 2025. Every headline number you celebrated was probably too high. Source: @KobeissiLetter / Writer: Oliver",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087217478887698710#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T16:40:00+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
