          ],
          "articles": []
        },
        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇮🇷 Professor Robert Pape just laid out why this war doesn't end anytime soon. His case: Iran's demands haven't grown randomly, they've tracked the Strategic Petroleum Reserve almost exactly. As the 400-million-barrel SPR release program drains, Iran's leverage rises in lockstep. Pape's point: America ran the reserve down for domestic political reasons under Biden instead of keeping it near its 700M-barrel ceiling, and we're paying for that decision now. Here's what most people missed. Back in April, Scott Bessent and corporate boardrooms started quietly planning pipelines to bypass Hormuz enti",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087214629252628511#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T16:28:40+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
          "org": "",
