        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸🇬🇱🇩🇰 Trump-linked oil company \"Greenland Energy\" just dumped drilling equipment on Greenland's coast WITHOUT permission. Greenland's Department of Industry and Minerals issued a \"strong warning\" in response. The U.S. needs new oil sources as Middle Eastern barrels dry up, and apparently asking nicely isn't part of the plan. If that move doesn't tell you that Trump doesn't respect Greenland's sovereignty I don't know what does. Source: The Cradle / Writer: Oliver",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087212446352097338#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T16:20:00+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
