        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇮🇷 Tehran hit send on the same Hormuz demands one more time. Security chief Mohsen Rezaei says the strait stays closed until the U.S. \"changes its behavior.\" Here we go again. What he wants: — End the war — Hand back Iran's frozen money — Stop everything across the region, including Lebanon and Gaza — Plus a few more things passed along through middlemen If any of that sounds familiar, it's because they said all of it last month too. Same strait, same list, same threat to sit on the world's oil until Washington caves. The only thing that ever changes is who's reading the statement out loud. Ev",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087211207728169064#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T16:15:05+00:00",
