        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸 Trump called out NYC’s second-home tax as a slowmotion DISASTER. The new surcharge is expected to pull in a few hundred million at best, while high earners keep packing for Florida and Texas and taking billions in tax revenue with them. Manhattan alone lost nearly $1B in adjusted income in one recent cycle. Layer on congestion pricing and the numbers look even worse for the city’s longterm base. When the people who actually pay the bills leave, the math stops working. Source: Truth Social / Writer: Lucas",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087209929287364805#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T16:10:00+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
