        },
        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸 Americans TREASURE their 2nd Amendment rights, so why does Michigan Sen. candidate Abdul El-Sayed want to take them away? Apparently, he advocated for REPLACING the 2nd Amendment with a \"constitutional right to healthcare.\" And wamted to stop Americans from using FIREWORKS on the 4th of July... what's next? No tree at Christmas? Maybe some of this would play in other countries, but from where most Americans stand on these issues, this guy is an absolute lunatic. \"Come and Take It\" yard signs incoming... 😂 Writer: Michael Video",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2087204896097652956#m",
          "date_utc": "2026-08-11T15:50:00+00:00",
          "is_curated": false,
